nhance Ability\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp/25px-Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp/38px-Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp/50px-Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enhance Ability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp/25px-Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Enhance_Ability_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enhance_Ability\" title=\"Enhance Ability\">Enhance Ability</a> Spell until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bear%27s_Endurance\" title=\"Bear's Endurance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/25px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/38px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/50px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bear's Endurance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp/25px-Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Bear%27s_Endurance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bear%27s_Endurance\" title=\"Bear's Endurance\">Bear's Endurance</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bull%27s_Strength\" title=\"Bull's Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Bull%27s_Strength_Icon.webp/25px-Bull%27s_Strength_Icon.we