Eagle%27s_Splendour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Eagle%27s_Splendour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eagle%27s_Splendour\" title=\"Eagle's Splendour\">Eagle's Splendour</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fox%27s_Cunning\" title=\"Fox's Cunning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp/25px-Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp/38px-Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp/50px-Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fox's Cunning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp/25px-Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Fox%27s_Cunning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fox%27s_Cunning\" title=\"Fox's Cunning\">Fox's Cunning</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Owl%27s_Wisdom\" title=\"Owl's Wisdom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp/25px-Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp/38px-Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp/50px-Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Owl's Wisdom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp/25px-Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Owl%27s_Wisdom_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Owl%27s_Wisdom\" title=\"Owl's Wisdom\">Owl's Wisdom</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given as part of a deal by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Auntie Ethel rewards the item if the player character agrees to have her attempt to remove the tadpole.</li>\n<li>In addition to the normal Enhance Ability effects, the charm also includes the following boosts: Carry Capacity is multiplied by 2; Fall Damage is multiplied by 0.5; and the consuming character gains 7 temporary HP.</li>\n<li>Despite Auntie Ethel's cruel and mischievous nature, using the charm comes with no negative side effects.</li>\n<li>Because this item is a <code>Local Item</code>, it can not be spawned using third party tools. Additionally, its effect is provided via an Osiris script.</li>\n<li>Prior to Patch 5 Auntie Ethel's Charm was a common item with a value of 1 gold.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached 